oduct detail page displayed \\\"This item is no longer available\\\" with no Add to Cart or Message Seller controls present (only \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" for the owner), confirming it cannot be added to cart or used to start a purchase request.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Signed in as Emma Green (non-owner), clicked \\\"Add to Cart\\\" on Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf (seller James Wilson). Cart page shows \\\"1 item\\\" with the item's photo, title, location (Portland, OR), price ($320), and Total $320.00.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf (owned by James Wilson, available), clicked \\\"Message Seller\\\", typed a non-empty message, clicked \\\"Send Message\\\". Toast \\\"Message sent to seller!\\\" appeared confirming submission.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Sellers have no way to view purchase requests or buyer messages\", \"actual\": \"As buyer (Emma), sent a Message Seller note and a cart \\\"Send Purchase Request\\\" to Marcus Chen's \\\"Vintage Denim Jacket\\\" listing (both confirmed sent via toasts). Logged in as Marcus Chen (the seller) and checked all reachable views: header icons, profile dropdown (My Profile, My Listings, Log out), My Listings page, and each listing's actions (View/Mark Sold/Delete) - none show received purchase requests or buyer messages. The \\\"My Profile\\\" link itself returns a 404 \\\"Page not found\\\". No requested item or buyer message is viewable by the seller anywhere in the app.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Login with nonexistent_user_xyz@example.com showed toast \\\"Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com\\\", stayed on /login, header still showed Log in/Sign up buttons (no session created).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Incorrect password is accepted, allowing sign-in without the correct password\", \"actual\": \"Logged in as emma@example.com using password \\\"wrongpassword123\\\" (never set by this account). App redirected to home page with toast \\\"Welcome back!\\\" and header showed authenticated user \\\"Emma Green\\\" with Sell button and profile menu, i.e. a signed-in session was created despite the wrong password.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Signed in as Emma Green: viewing her own listing (Mid-Century Modern Armchair) showed a \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" button and no buyer actions. Viewing another seller's listing (Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf, seller James Wilson) showed only \\\"Add to Cart\\\" and \\\"Message Seller\\\" buttons with no Mark Sold/Delete/Manage controls.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No missing-field feedback shown to seller\", \"actual\": \"Clicking \\\"Create Listing\\\" with all fields empty (no photo, title, description, price, category, condition, location) did not submit and did not navigate away, but produced no toast, inline error text, or any element with error/alert styling identifying which fields were missing - only the title textbox silently gained focus.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting the create-listing form with price=-10 (all other required fields valid) did not navigate away and no listing was created (form remained on /create-listing with price field refocused). The price input is type=number, so attempting to set a non-numeric value (\\\"abc\\\") via the field results in an empty value, preventing non-numeric submission.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Unauthenticated direct access to protected routes shows a blank page instead of a sign-in prompt or redirect\", \"actual\": \"While signed out: clicking \\\"Add to Cart\\\" correctly redirected to /login with a toast. Clicking \\\"Message Seller\\\" opened a dialog with a disabled \\\"Log in to message\\\" button (acceptable clear prompt). However, directly visiting /create-listing or /cart while signed out rendered a completely blank page (no content, no redirect, no login prompt - document.body.innerText was empty), leaving the user with no indication that sign-in is required.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking Add to Cart immediately produced toast \\\"Added to cart!\\\" and the header cart icon badge updated to \\\"1\\\" without navigation/reload. Opening the cart showed the line item, photo, location, price, and correct $320.00 total, all reflecting the addition without manual reload.\"}]}"
